Stage 2-1 - 按住_8_+_B 

Stage 2-2 - 按住_8_+_A  

Stage 3-1 - 按住_2_+_B 

Stage 3-2 - 按住_2_+_A 

Stage 4-1 - 按住_4_+_B 

Stage 4-2 - 按住_4_+_A 

Stage 5-1 - 按住_6_+_B 

Stage 5-2 - 按住_6_+_A 

最终BOSS  - 按住_3_+_A
$end

